This repository combines components with their retained upstream licenses.

spider/ and action/: the SPIDER license in licenses/SPIDER.txt (CC BY-NC 4.0).
visual/: the robosuite license in licenses/ROBOSUITE.txt (MIT, with its retained
MuJoCo implementation notice).

The inherited noncommercial restriction remains on the action component. The
combined repository is a research source release; it is not wholly MIT-licensed.
Prepared dataset inputs and robot/object assets retain their source terms. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and UPSTREAMS.json for provenance.
